       length)

       IIBBVV__RREERREEGG__MMRR__CCHHAANNGGEE__PPDD  Change protection domain

       IIBBVV__RREERREEGG__MMRR__CCHHAANNGGEE__AACCCCEESSSS  Change access flags

       When  IIBBVV__RREERREEGG__MMRR__CCHHAANNGGEE__PPDD  is used, _p_d represents the new PD this MR
       should be registered to.
       When IIBBVV__RREERREEGG__MMRR__CCHHAANNGGEE__TTRRAANNSSLLAATTIIOONN is  used,  _a_d_d_r.   represents  the
